    {
      "name": "Breastplate",
      "unlock": "Elemental Skill",
      "description": "Summons a protective stone armor, dealing Geo DMG to surrounding enemies and creating a shield. The shield's DMG Absorption scaled based on Noelle's DEF.\n\nThe shield has the following properties:\n\nWhen Noelle's Normal and Charged Attacks hit a target, they have a certain chance to regenerate HP for all characters, both on and off the field.\nApplies the Geo element to the character.\nPossesses 250% Absorption Efficiency against Geo DMG.\n\nThe amount of HP healed when regeneration is triggered scales based on Noelle's DEF.",
      "upgrades": [
        {
          "name": "Skill DMG",
          "value": "120% DEF"
        },
        {
          "name": "DMG Absorption",
          "value": "160% DEF + 770"
