      "img": "https://pub-1ad979b6618d4a07ab871591a84b954c.r2.dev/noelle/talent-skill.png"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sweeping Time",
      "unlock": "Elemental Burst",
      "description": "Gathering the strength of stone around her weapon, Noelle strikes the enemies surrounding her within a large AoE, dealing Geo DMG.\n\nAfterwards, Noelle gains the following effects:\n\nLarger attack AoE.\nConverts attack DMG to Geo DMG.\nIncreased ATK that scales based on her DEF.",
      "upgrades": [
